OL,4,CGovernment to be asked for advice on   
OL,5,Chomes plan                             
OL,6,GThe government will be asked to get    
OL,7,Ginvolved in a planning decision for    
OL,8,G150 homes due to fears it will         
OL,9,Gexacerbate a town's flooding issues.   
OL,11,FNorth Norfolk District Council's       
OL,12,Fplanning committee deferred a decision 
OL,13,Fon the Ingham Road housing estate in   
OL,14,FStalham on Thursday.                   
OL,16,FAnglian Water had objected to the      
OL,17,Fproposals, saying its sewage network   
OL,18,Fwould not be able to accommodate the   
OL,19,Fadditional demand and there would be   
OL,20,Fan "unacceptable risk of flooding".    
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
