OL,4,C#2.5bn data centre refused planning    
OL,5,Cpermission                             
OL,6,GCouncillors have voted to refuse       
OL,7,Gplanning permission for a #2.5bn data  
OL,8,Gcentre next to a travellers site.      
OL,10,FArk Data Centres had applied to build  
OL,11,Fa set of four-storey data centres on   
OL,12,Fthe site of the former Mercure Hotel   
OL,13,Fin Bushey, Hertfordshire.              
OL,15,FAlthough Hertsmere Borough Council     
OL,16,Fplanning officers recommended          
OL,17,Fpermission be granted, eight           
OL,18,Fcouncillors voted against the scheme,  
OL,19,Fwhile five voted in favour at a        
OL,20,Fmeeting on Thursday.                   
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
