OL,4,CMarried prison tutor had X-rated fling 
OL,5,Cwith inmate                            
OL,6,GA married prison tutor who sent naked  
OL,7,Gphotographs of herself to an inmate    
OL,8,Ghas been given a suspended jail        
OL,9,Gsentence.                              
OL,11,FOksana Antanaitiene's secret fling at  
OL,12,FHMP Chelmsford was uncovered when she  
OL,13,Fwas found locked in an office with the 
OL,14,Fprisoner in August 2025.               
OL,16,FStaff went on to find the 52-year-old  
OL,17,Fmaths tutor from Grays, Essex, had     
OL,18,Fused a USB drive to smuggle music and  
OL,19,FTV files to him, as well as the X-     
OL,20,Frated images.                          
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
